  "description": "Implement cloud cost optimization strategies for Kubernetes workloads using tools like Kubecost for visibility, right-sizing recommendations, horizontal and vertical pod autoscaling, spot/preemptible instances, and resource quotas. Covers cost allocation, showback reporting, and continuous optimization practices. Use when cloud costs are growing without proportional business value, when resource requests are misaligned with actual usage, when manual scaling leads to over-provisioning, or when implementing showback and chargeback for internal cost accountability.",
